  {
   "id": "evergate-105453@major-2020-10-29",
   "gameId": "evergate-105453",
   "displayName": "New Quality of Life Update - live now on Steam!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-10-29T13:17:09.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone! A new update for Evergate is now live on Steam. Whether you're new to Evergate, or attempting a record speed run(!), we hope that the improvements help to make the game even more accessible and enjoyable. Details of the updates are as follows:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "This new mode allows you to",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Choose invincibility.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Change the game speed (giving yourself more time to think and react).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Unlock all first artefacts.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Further Updates",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Reduced artefact costs from 6 >12>21 to 3>10>21 to make it easier to boost Ki's abilities.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Stone Egg artefact is now the first unlocked artefact in Stage 2.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The third artefact is a brand new artefact!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Stages 1-1 and 1-2 have been altered to aid new players.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The potency of the Crow enemies has been reduced. They are slightly slower and come in from a greater distance.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A new tutorial in stage 1-2 teaches players how to collect and use essence to aid progress.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In contrast, in Speed Run Mode the tutorials in stages 1-1 and 1-2 can now be skipped.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Precision Mode features new animation and behaviour allowing you to adjust the general aiming direction first.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added optional release button/mouse to fire Soulflame preference.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "We've loved reading how much players have been enjoying the hand-drawn artwork in Evergate and have also added a new animated loading splash screen!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "PQube & Stone Lantern Games",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
